<title>USA: PerSeptive says gets U.S. patent.</title>
<headline>PerSeptive says gets U.S. patent.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerSeptive Biosystems Inc said on Thursday the it had been issued a U.S. patent for its Perfusion Chromatography systems.</p>
<p>The patent broadens protection of the company's Perfusion Chromatography technology to include instruments and systems that perform its patented high-speed, high resolution chromatography, PerSeptive said.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1733</p>
</text>
